<!-- property t -->
```rust
Point<Celsius, Fixed<Kelvin, Milli, i16>>
```

**°C**

- origin: `Celsius` (°C), at 273.15 K
- unit: `Kelvin` (K)
- scale: 10⁻³ (`Milli`), exact
- step: 0.001 °C
- range: −32.768 ..= 32.767 °C (`Unbounded`, -32768 ..= 32767 steps)
- storage: `i16`, 2 bytes on the wire

